; The six room types of the 1991 game (RODENT2.FRM LevelDraw and the
; mplvl* tables).  They repeat in order, so level 7 is room 1 again,
; with more holes, traps and speed from the level number.

name: Rodent's Revenge
author: Christopher Lee Fraley
year: 1991
description: The original levels, generated fresh every time you play.

[level]
name: Block Square
pattern: square
blocks: 100
difficulty: 0
batch: 3
wave: 3
interval: 5

[level]
name: Walled Square
pattern: square
blocks: 90
difficulty: 1
batch: 3
wave: 3
interval: 4

[level]
name: Scattered
pattern: scatter
blocks: 87
difficulty: 2
batch: 6
wave: 4
interval: 5

[level]
name: Checkerboard
pattern: checker
blocks: 100
difficulty: 3
batch: 2
wave: 2
interval: 2

[level]
name: Rubble
pattern: scatter
blocks: 50
difficulty: 4
batch: 4
wave: 3
interval: 3

[level]
name: Wall Grid
pattern: checker-walls
blocks: 50
difficulty: 5
batch: 4
wave: 3
interval: 4
